00:12:50,900 --> 00:12:51,721
我会告诉德怀特他必须搬出去
after the game tonight.

351
00:12:51,731 --> 00:12:52,670
谢谢你
Thank you.

352
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:54,753
虽然你们不在乎  但还是说一声
Not that anybody cares, but for lunch,

353
00:12:54,958 --> 00:12:56,060
我午饭只吃到一粒润喉糖
I had a lozenge.

354
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,610
这事多久能办完
So, uh, how long is this going to take?

355
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:03,750
我只是需要再订一些宣传用的飞盘
I just need to reorder some promotional Frisbees,

356
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:05,720
顺便和梅尔夫打声招呼
and say a quick hi to Merv,

357
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:07,710
这位天才在过去十多年里
the genius who supplied me with coasters

358
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:09,420
一直帮我做杯垫和钥匙链
and key chains for over a decade.

359
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,321
他甚至还把我的脸印在枕头上呢
He even put my face on a pillow.

360
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:13,680
这个故事让我想找个枕头来闷死自己
That story makes me want to put a pillow over my face.

361
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:15,575
咱速战速决行吗  我四点还得去做美黑
Can we just get this over with? I have a spray tan at 4:00.

362
00:13:16,180 --> 00:13:17,841
美黑  谁需要做美黑
Spray tan! Who needs a spray tan?

363
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:18,621
冬天没得晒太阳的人需要
Someone in winter.

364
00:13:19,140 --> 00:13:21,360
所以美黑优惠劵就得跟冰铲配
That's why you put a coupon on a ice scraper.

365
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:24,313
厉害吧  又挣够钱送我一个孙子去好大学
Boom! Just sent another grandkid to Brandeis.

366
00:13:24,558 --> 00:13:25,780
他一出手  就是正中红心
He shoots, he scores!

367
00:13:26,460 --> 00:13:28,990
你能相信这位青年才俊的孙子都上大学了吗
Can you believe this young man has a grandkid in college?

368
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,813
年轻与否都是由生活方式决定的
Mm! It's all about lifestyle.

369
00:13:31,017 --> 00:13:32,670
真的  我每天健走八公里
Really, I walk five miles a day,

370
00:13:32,690 --> 00:13:34,740
还做过一大堆整形手术
and I've had a tremendous amount of plastic surgery.

371
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:38,565
关于你那幢急于卖出去的房产
Oh! I had a brainstorm on that property of yours

372
00:13:38,606 --> 00:13:39,500
我脑力激荡了一番
that you're trying to unload.

373
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:40,486
就是死过人那幢
You know, where the people -- Ckkk!

374
00:13:40,980 --> 00:13:41,508
是啊
Yeah.

375
00:13:42,463 --> 00:13:44,322
你把它当成卖点
You lean into it. Hmm?

376
00:13:45,123 --> 00:13:46,700
你叫它"大屠杀庄园"
You-You call it "Massacre Manor,"

377
00:13:47,429 --> 00:13:48,487
"唐顿墓园"
"Downton Stabby,"

378
00:13:48,508 --> 00:13:48,813
"杀人魔曼森[大宅]"
"Charles Mansion."

379
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,780
类似的双关梗我能想出无数个
I mean, like, I-I got a million of them.

380
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:54,800
其实大概还能想出仨
Actually, I probably -- I have three more.

381
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:56,470
瞧见没  大师
See? A master.

382
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,041
梅尔夫  这是我女儿海莉
Aww. Merv, meet my daughter Haley.

383
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,196
很高兴见到你
Nice to meet you.

384
00:13:59,216 --> 00:14:00,550
你爸告诉我
Your daddy tells me

385
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:03,260
你被麦德逊大道[广告业]的热情感染了
that you have come down with the Madison Avenue flu.

386
00:14:03,500 --> 00:14:05,378
他说的话我一个字都听不懂
I don't understand anything that's happening here.

387
00:14:05,398 --> 00:14:07,441
我看《嘻哈帝国》时也是这种感觉
I feel the same way when I watch "Empire."

388
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:10,560
不是吧你
Oh! No, you don't!

389
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:14,454
有只脏猫总是坐到我新买的劳斯莱斯顶上
Some mangy cat keeps sitting on the roof of my new Rolls.

390
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,241
梅尔夫收集名车
Merv collects cars.

391
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:18,250
不是我显摆  但我收集的车
Not to brag, but I could do a production

392
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:20,380
都够拍《十二怒汉》汽车版了
of "12 Angry Men" starring cars.

393
00:14:21,740 --> 00:14:23,201
不是吧你  太妃喵
No, you don't, Taffy!

394
00:14:24,806 --> 00:14:25,762
他的话是什么意思
What-What is he talking about?

395
00:14:25,782 --> 00:14:26,900
感染麦德逊大道的热情是什么
What's Madison Avenue flu?

396
00:14:27,380 --> 00:14:28,990
我好像跟他提过
Oh. I-I may have mentioned that you had a --

397
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,990
你对宣传推广行业萌生了兴趣
a budding interest in the promotional arts,

398
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,870
撞大运的是  梅尔夫的助手
and, total stroke of luck, Merv's assistant

399
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:34,600
得了很重很重的病
is very, very sick.

400
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:37,090
等等  你觉得我的事业
Wait a minute. You think my business

401
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:38,744
和"卡尔的改车行"马桶座圈
is in the same universe as

402
00:14:38,785 --> 00:14:41,080
是同一个宇宙里吗
Carl's Auto Body toilet seat covers?

403
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:43,193
多亏那个宝贝的福
Carl just opened a third location

404
00:14:43,255 --> 00:14:44,300
卡尔刚刚开了第三家分店了
because of that wizard.

405
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:46,580
你只剩两条命了  太妃喵
You got two lives left, Taffy!

406
00:14:46,590 --> 00:14:47,690
你就打算这么用这两条命吗
Is this how you want to spend them?!

407
00:14:47,700 --> 00:14:49,930
我不需要找工作  我已经有工作了
I don't need a job. I have one.

408
00:14:49,940 --> 00:14:51,230
你不是"懂你"战队的吗
What happened to "Team Gets It"?

409
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,421
其实我不懂
Well, I don't gets it.

410
00:14:53,349 --> 00:14:54,650
看起来你只是混在舞厅里
Just seems like you're hanging out at clubs

411
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:56,600
和一群派对女拍照而已
taking pictures with a bunch of party girls.

412
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:57,823
我也想当个潮爸
I mean, I want to be hip,

413
00:14:58,007 --> 00:14:59,536
但我压根搞不懂这些是在干嘛
but none of this makes any sense to me.

414
00:14:59,577 --> 00:15:00,920
我只是希望你能得到最好的
I just want what's best for you.

415
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:03,979
多谢"激励"  也多谢你小看我
Nice pep talk. Oh, and thanks for underestimating me.

416
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,694
如果你是奥威尔·瑞登巴克的爹
You know, if you were Orville Redenbacher's dad,

417
00:15:05,959 --> 00:15:07,180
飞机永远不会被发明出来
we wouldn't have airplanes!

418
00:15:07,204 --> 00:15:08,557
打败你了
Got ya!

419
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:13,340
看来九命怪猫也不代表就能次次命大
I guess they don't always land on their feet.

420
00:15:25,538 --> 00:15:26,622
触地得分
Touchdown!

421
00:15:27,091 --> 00:15:27,760
那个德怀特真是厉害
That Dwight's something, huh?

422
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,361
是啊  他还行吧
Yeah! Well, he's fine, you know.

423
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:30,545
这是项团体性运动
It's-It's a team sport,

424
00:15:30,954 --> 00:15:32,241
他要是不在了大概都没人会想他
so, you know, they probably wouldn't even miss him.

425
00:15:33,140 --> 00:15:34,202
我只想说一句
I just want to say

426
00:15:34,243 --> 00:15:36,860
-我很欣赏您的选择  -谢谢
- I love what you're doing. - Well, thank you.

427
00:15:37,145 --> 00:15:38,740
我都是用这种裤子来搭这件毛衣
I-I wear this sweater with these trousers a lot.

428
00:15:38,750 --> 00:15:39,658
当你的腰部很高
When you're high-waisted,

429
00:15:39,699 --> 00:15:42,181
要找到能相衬的上下身衣裤真的很难...
it is very difficult finding pieces that work together, so...

430
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:44,930
你的确看起来很时髦  但她的意思是
Yeah, you look really nice, but what she means is

431
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:46,940
您选择让德怀特住在你们家的举动很高尚
it's great that you're letting Dwight live with you.

432
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:49,291
你收留了德怀特吗
You're taking Dwight in?

433
00:15:49,300 --> 00:15:50,626
-听起来不像你的作风啊  -这个
- That doesn't sound like you. - It's -- It's --

434
00:15:50,646 --> 00:15:52,055
他要逼他搬出去
He's making him move out.

435
00:15:52,157 --> 00:15:53,260
那听起来倒像你的作风
That sounds like you.

436
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,361
你们好  废柴们
Hey, losers.

437
00:15:54,402 --> 00:15:57,095
我就感觉在小卖部[老人站牌]看到的是你
Thought I'd see you down at the concession stand.

438
00:15:57,116 --> 00:15:58,809
你想了多久才想到这个双关语
How long were you working on that one?

439
00:15:58,829 --> 00:16:02,174
这是你给卢克写的演讲稿里的笑话吗
Is that one of the gems that you wrote into Luke's speech?

440
00:16:02,645 --> 00:16:05,620
我告诉你们  卢克的演讲稿是他自己写的
I will have you know that Luke wrote his own speech.

441
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:07,242
他参与了写作
He contributed.

442
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:09,381
他在场而已
He was there. Mm.

443
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:18,045
你这身西装是怎么回事
What's with the suit?

444
00:16:18,395 --> 00:16:20,860
还说我  你为什么穿得跟女歌手麻辣鸡似的
Me? Why are you dressed like Nicki Minaj?

445
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,780
我妈和杰说这样会让我更能引起共鸣
My mom and Jay said it made me more relatable.

446
00:16:23,060 --> 00:16:24,044
我觉得自己像个白痴一样
I feel like an idiot.

447
00:16:24,290 --> 00:16:25,433
是啊  我也是
Yeah. Me too.

448
00:16:26,085 --> 00:16:28,413
我妈逼我穿成这样  好让我更像你
My mom forced me to wear this so I'd be more like you.

449
00:16:28,658 --> 00:16:30,520
说得好像我会用棕色皮带配黑皮鞋一样
Yeah, because I'd wear a brown belt with black shoes?

450
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:32,104
你知道我们该怎么做吗
You know what we should do?

451
00:16:32,145 --> 00:16:34,540
弃稿  发自内心去演讲
Throw out our speeches and speak from the heart.

452
00:16:35,380 --> 00:16:36,461
真是个好主意
That's a great idea.

453
00:16:37,540 --> 00:16:39,025
你忘带演讲稿了是不是
Mm. You forgot your speech, didn't you?

454
00:16:39,335 --> 00:16:40,141
我要行使第二修正案法
I plead the second.

455
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:43,045
另外你们该知道
Also, uh, You should know,

456
00:16:43,188 --> 00:16:46,410
三个行凶者里已经有两个被抓到了
they arrested two of the three perpetrators.

457
00:16:46,430 --> 00:16:47,695
宝贝  你来这做什么
Hey, honey. What are you doing here?

458
00:16:48,063 --> 00:16:48,840
证明自己
Making a point.

459
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:50,321
你们好
Oh. Hey.

460
00:16:50,331 --> 00:16:52,248
我是菲尔·邓菲
Uh, I-I'm Phil Dunphy.

461
00:16:52,269 --> 00:16:54,063
有问题的话  尽管问
Feel free to ask any... questions.

462
00:16:54,145 --> 00:16:54,980
脖子上的纹身不错
Sweet neck tattoo.

463
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,781
别忘了在访客登记簿上签名
Don't forget to sign the guest book.

464
00:16:57,300 --> 00:16:58,881
这些不是你工作上的朋友吗
Aren't these your, uh -- your work friends?

465
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,066
没错  等一下
Yeah. Hold on a second.

466
00:17:00,086 --> 00:17:01,722
亚利桑那  你又撅鸭子嘴了
Hey, Arizona! Quack quack.

467
00:17:01,972 --> 00:17:02,201
抱歉
Sorry.

468
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:06,108
我知道你不认为我做的是正经工作
Look, I know you don't think what I'm doing is real,

469
00:17:06,149 --> 00:17:08,188
但我们刚刚才通过我们在各个平台上的账号
but we just posted about this terrible house

470
00:17:08,249 --> 00:17:10,044
发布了这间烂房子的出售信息
through all our accounts on multiple platforms,

471
00:17:10,085 --> 00:17:11,451
现在慕名而来的人已经一大堆了
and there's already a ton of people here,

472
00:17:11,594 --> 00:17:13,060
所以说  不用谢啦
so, uh, you're welcome.

473
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:20,260
我们真不需要搞这些  但好吧
We don't really need all this stuff, but okay.

474
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:21,414
好了  各位观众
All right, everybody.

475
00:17:21,434 --> 00:17:23,475
在我们的仪仗队粉墨登场
Before our marching band takes the field

476
00:17:23,516 --> 00:17:26,229
带来致敬扎克·埃夫隆系列电影的表演之前
with their tribute to the films of Zac Efron,

477
00:17:26,597 --> 00:17:28,022
让我们有请两位候选人
let's hear from our two candidates

478
00:17:28,083 --> 00:17:29,655
带来他们学生会主席的竞选演讲
for Student Council President.

479
00:17:29,717 --> 00:17:31,421
首先出场的是曼尼·迪尔加多
First up is Manny Delgado.

480
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:35,678
实际上  我们打算一起完成这次演讲
Actually, we're going to speak together.

481
00:17:36,413 --> 00:17:38,450
卢克和我站在这里  是希望赢得你们的投票
Luke and I are here because we each want your votes.

482
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:41,044
然而  某些人却一心想改变我们
However, certain people want to change us

483
00:17:41,084 --> 00:17:42,720
让我们变得完全不像我们自己
into being something each of us is not.

484
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:45,474
-他们居然这样公开羞辱我们  -是我们自找的
- They're publicly shaming us. - We deserve it.

485
00:17:45,515 --> 00:17:47,438
最重要的是你们两位家长学到教训
The important thing is you two learned something.

486
00:17:47,458 --> 00:17:48,361
省省吧  大家长
Save it, patriarch.

487
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,870
我们想说的是  我们是两个
The point is, we are two individuals

488
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:53,361
拥有著截然不同的个性和想法的人
with our own unique personalties and ideas.

489
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:55,261
他说得没错
What he said.

490
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:57,155
最后我赢了
I won.

491
00:17:57,175 --> 00:18:00,320
这次创了学校历史上最低的投票记录
It was the lowest voter turnout in school history.

492
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:01,724
选民讨厌我们俩
They hated the both of us.

493
00:18:02,438 --> 00:18:03,281
不过更讨厌你一点
But you more.

494
00:18:07,100 --> 00:18:09,323
我不得不承认  我确实佩服你真的带来了
I got to admit, I'm really impressed that you got

495
00:18:09,344 --> 00:18:10,936
这么一大屋子人  不过他们...
all these people here, but they, um --

496
00:18:11,836 --> 00:18:13,531
看起来不太像会买房子的人
they don't really look like house buyers.

497
00:18:13,552 --> 00:18:15,421
爸  你完全不会看这年代的有钱人
Dad, you have no idea who has money anymore.

498
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:16,535
看到那个女孩了吗
You see that girl?

499
00:18:16,861 --> 00:18:18,899
她靠玩电脑游戏就能赚进六位数
She makes six figures playing video games.

500
00:18:19,490 --> 00:18:21,287
还有那个男的  他发明了一个应用
And that dude, he invented an app

501
00:18:21,307 --> 00:18:22,961
专门用来吐槽朋友  叫做最佳"损"友
for trashing your friends called App Smear.

502
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:25,369
他们里面随便谁都买得起这房子
Oh. Any one of these people could buy this house.

503
00:18:25,430 --> 00:18:28,450
而如果他们买下了  我们从你的佣金中抽头
And if they do, you give us a percentage of your commission.

504
00:18:28,798 --> 00:18:29,800
这就是我们的生财之道
That's how we make money.

505
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,446
你是这个房子的中介吗
You the realtor?

506
00:18:31,466 --> 00:18:32,160
正是在下
Indeed, I am.

507
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:33,601
我挺喜欢这里的
I like this place.

508
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:36,760
能指给我看看凶案发生的地方吗
Show me where it happened.

509
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:39,470
就在...这个走廊的尽头
Um, it's...right down this hall.

510
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,741
您先请
After you.

511
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:42,239
她爸爸可有钱了
Her dad's loaded.

512
00:18:42,749 --> 00:18:44,338
顺便提一下  你看过房子的价格了吗
By the way, have you seen the price?

513
00:18:44,419 --> 00:18:47,021
房东不是这里唯一被砍过的东西  还有房价
The, uh -- The owner wasn't the only thing that's been slashed.

514
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:55,093
海豚队获胜  21比20
And the Dolphins win, 21-20.

515
00:18:55,163 --> 00:18:56,265
厉害了
All right!

516
00:18:57,384 --> 00:18:59,230
那个男孩就像职业选手一样
That boy is like a professional.

517
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:02,556
一个男孩就差不多带整队赢了  太厉害了
It's amazing how one kid can carry a whole team.

518
00:19:02,576 --> 00:19:03,860
我感觉你就是故意说给我听的
I feel like you're doing this on purpose.

